{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29036","headline":"南海府罢南康阻浅行侣稍登陆而迈主人燕饯至频暮宿东溪 · 许浑","name":"南海府罢南康阻浅行侣稍登陆而迈主人燕饯至频暮宿东溪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暗滩水落涨虚沙，滩去秦吴万里赊。\n马上折残江北柳，舟中开尽岭南花。\n离歌不断如留客，归梦初惊似到家。\n山鸟一声人未起，半牀春月在天涯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29036.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29036","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}